{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach Point</strong> is a physics-based party game for up to 2 players, offering both <i>couch co-op</i> and <i>competitive</i> fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features 3 unique game modes, each bringing a different kind of chaotic challenge to your living room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>REACH POINT MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friend \u2014 or go solo\u00a0<strong><u>(ONLY THIS MODE CAN SUPPORT ONE PLAYER)</u></strong> \u2014 to overcome tricky obstacles and prove you can reach the <strong>Reach point</strong> together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/d6b7c9d4c73675c3384adccf3c0c5627.poster.avif?t=1765310689\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/d6b7c9d4c73675c3384adccf3c0c5627.webm?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/d6b7c9d4c73675c3384adccf3c0c5627.mp4?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BATTLE MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head with your buddy across multiple rounds and find out who\u2019s the true climbing champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/574f7cc52d79481536924c45a634cedb.poster.avif?t=1765310689\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/574f7cc52d79481536924c45a634cedb.webm?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/574f7cc52d79481536924c45a634cedb.mp4?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PATHMAKER MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your platforms wisely, create your own path and race your friend to the finish line \u2013 just don't get killed by the platform you created!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/e8fcd63fab30ca111950a9fb393a6a82.poster.avif?t=1765310689\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/e8fcd63fab30ca111950a9fb393a6a82.webm?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/e8fcd63fab30ca111950a9fb393a6a82.mp4?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re working together or battling it out, Reach Point turns every climb into chaos, laughter, and unforgettable moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4159950?t=1765310689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4159950?t=1765310689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/178978165db17b5789bc98a7fbf996cdd6d77c4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765310689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/178978165db17b5789bc98a7fbf996cdd6d77c4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765310689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach Point</strong> is a physics-based party game for up to 2 players, offering both <i>couch co-op</i> and <i>competitive</i> fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features 3 unique game modes, each bringing a different kind of chaotic challenge to your living room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>REACH POINT MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friend \u2014 or go solo\u00a0<strong><u>(ONLY THIS MODE CAN SUPPORT ONE PLAYER)</u></strong> \u2014 to overcome tricky obstacles and prove you can reach the <strong>Reach point</strong> together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/d6b7c9d4c73675c3384adccf3c0c5627.poster.avif?t=1765310689\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/d6b7c9d4c73675c3384adccf3c0c5627.webm?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/d6b7c9d4c73675c3384adccf3c0c5627.mp4?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BATTLE MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head with your buddy across multiple rounds and find out who\u2019s the true climbing champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/574f7cc52d79481536924c45a634cedb.poster.avif?t=1765310689\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/574f7cc52d79481536924c45a634cedb.webm?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/574f7cc52d79481536924c45a634cedb.mp4?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PATHMAKER MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your platforms wisely, create your own path and race your friend to the finish line \u2013 just don't get killed by the platform you created!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/e8fcd63fab30ca111950a9fb393a6a82.poster.avif?t=1765310689\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/e8fcd63fab30ca111950a9fb393a6a82.webm?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/extras/e8fcd63fab30ca111950a9fb393a6a82.mp4?t=1765310689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re working together or battling it out, Reach Point turns every climb into chaos, laughter, and unforgettable moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Game Socks Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159950/2757c047621f09807a9e8db5ae833b9f3012bedc/header.jpg?t=1765310689","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.ste